    <name>
      <text>Completing Abridged Life Tables involving d_x,l_x,p_x and q_x</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Complete the life table below. (Note: Leave your answers for \(p_x\) to \(4\) decimal places; round your values for \(l_x\) and \(d_x\) to the nearest integer.)</p>
<br>
<p>
